Lane B (Phase 2, 2026-09-18): pass the already-in-scope `language` variable
into the three utils/directory_fields.py calls this lane made
language-aware (remove_unrequested_directory_fields,
restore_missing_requested_directory_fields, directory_field_conflicts).
Every one of these calls already has a `language` local in scope in
app/orchestrator/chat_orchestrator.py; this is a same-line keyword addition,
nothing else. Lane B does not edit chat_orchestrator.py directly (single
writer: the coordinator) - this patch is for the coordinator to apply.

Backward compatible: every one of these functions defaults `language="en"`,
byte-identical to today's un-language-aware behaviour, so this patch changes
nothing until it is applied - and even then only for callers that reach the
orchestrator's own `language` value.

